	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Infineon FS02MR12A8MA2B HybridPACK Drive G2 SiC module, PressFIT. 30 signal pins: finished hole 1.02-1.10 mm (unique 1.06 mm drill used so pins land in their own drill file; recommended drill tool 1.15 mm; immersion tin finish), pad Ø2.1 mm (>=0.5 mm annular). Origin = X guide hole (Ø4.1 NPTH); Y guide slot 4.1x4.5 NPTH with long axis on the guide-to-guide line (59deg). Heat-stake holes Ø3.6 NPTH (6x), screw dome holes Ø3.6 NPTH at functional domes D1,D3,D4,D5,D7,D8 only (no holes at domes D2/D6). D1 signal pin X=-48.65 is a verified inference from drawing W00201873_05. Courtyard is a conservative rectangle - exact module outline comes from the STEP model. Board-level keepouts: >=3-4 mm component keepout radius around every press-fit hole; Ø6 mm topside clearance at heat-stake positions. Datasheet Rev 1.00 2024-04-19, Figures 2-4.")
	(tags "Infineon HybridPACK Drive G2 PressFIT SiC module")
